sequenceDiagram
    actor U as Student
    participant B as Browser
    participant L as Laravel
    participant P as CoursePolicy
    participant D as MySQL
    participant F as Private Storage

    U->>B: Buka halaman lesson
    B->>L: GET /lessons/{id}
    L->>L: Middleware auth (sudah login?)
    L->>D: Ambil lesson dan course
    L->>P: view(user, course)
    alt Admin atau course published
        P-->>L: diizinkan
        L-->>B: Halaman dengan tag video
        B->>L: GET /lessons/{id}/video (+ header Range)
        L->>P: view(user, course)
        L->>D: Cek video_status = ready
        L->>F: Baca file video
        L-->>B: 206 Partial Content (stream video)
    else Course draft dan user student
        P-->>L: ditolak
        L-->>B: 403 Forbidden
    end
